And i disagree again: most of my characters won't survive two rounds
of melee against the riders, so they usually have to kill from a
distance or play hit-and-retreat while very fast. For that, Famine is
easiest, with Pestilence a close second: both are susceptible to death
rays and both can be drained to nothing, making them effectively
harmless. Death requires magic missiles or ranged weapons and can't be
drained. Death also drains maxhp, which becomes very seriously Not Fun
when you start at ~140.

Conflict works nicely when the riders are in the middle of a crowd.
And if you managed to hole them up in a convenient place, a boulder
may be worth a wish ...

